    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Savills are delighted to present Dunard, a truly magnificent, detached family residence set on approximately 1.3 acres of beautifully appointed grounds, enjoying an elevated position with exceptional panoramic views across the surrounding countryside.\r\n\r\nConstructed circa 2011 and finished to an exacting standard throughout, Dunard offers an outstanding combination of luxury, comfort and privacy. The property has been meticulously maintained and thoughtfully enhanced by its owners, resulting in a home of exceptional quality in turnkey condition.\r\n\r\nApproached through electric security gates, a sweeping tarmacadam driveway bordered by low granite walls and mature silver birch trees leads to the house, providing a striking first impression and ample parking to the front and side. The elevated setting affords far-reaching views extending across five counties, a rare and particularly attractive feature.\r\n\r\nThe quality of craftsmanship is immediately evident on arrival, with an impressive cut-stone façade and a statement front door opening into a magnificent double-height galleried entrance hall with marble flooring, setting the tone for the accommodation throughout. \r\n\r\nTo the right lies a beautifully proportioned drawing room with solid Iroko timber flooring, centred around a feature Limestone fireplace, which flows seamlessly into a bright conservatory opening onto the sun-drenched south-facing patio. To the left of the hall is a contemporary open-plan living and dining room, also with solid Iroko timber flooring, with an inset gas fireplace and floating Limestone shelf, leading through to a superbly appointed kitchen. The kitchen is fitted to a high specification, featuring a large natural stone sliding island, an extensive range of Miele integrated appliances and direct access to the rear garden, complemented by a separate utility room. A guest WC and comms room complete the ground floor living accommodation.\r\n\r\nAt first floor level, there are four generously proportioned double bedrooms, all luxuriously appointed with extensive built-in storage. Three bedrooms benefit from en suite bathrooms, while a well-finished family bathroom serves the fourth. Several of the bedrooms enjoy particularly impressive countryside views.\r\n\r\nA standout feature of Dunard is its exceptional facilities. The indoor swimming pool complex is a remarkable addition, complete with adjoining steam room, jacuzzi and changing facilities, including a shower, creating a superb private wellness suite. A gym area further enhances this space. Above, an expansive and stylishly fitted bar and entertaining area provides a superb setting for hosting with a firepit dining and seating area and outdoor guest toilet facilities. This is all complemented by an adjoining cinema room for an enhanced home entertainment experience.\r\n\r\nThe grounds are both private and immaculately maintained, with expansive lawns to the front framed by mature planting and colourful borders. To the rear, a generous granite-paved patio provides an ideal setting for outdoor entertaining and al fresco dining, while a discreetly positioned putting green offers an additional lifestyle amenity."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Exceptional countryside views\r\nApprox. 1.3 acres of mature, manicured grounds\r\nIndoor swimming pool complex\r\nHome bar and cinema room \r\nUnderfloor heating throughout\r\nSuperbly located approx. 20km from Dublin City Centre"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Location",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Dunard is ideally situated at Redgap, a desirable hamlet just outside the village of Rathcoole offering a wonderful balance of tranquil countryside living and excellent connectivity to Dublin City and its surrounding amenities.\r\n\r\nRathcoole village is just a short drive away and provides a range of local services including shops, cafés, schools and everyday conveniences. Of particular note is the popular Avoca Rathcoole, located within easy reach, offering a well-regarded food market, café and retail experience.\r\n\r\nThe location is highly convenient for commuters, with Dublin City Centre approximately 20 km away and readily accessible via the N7, which also provides swift connection to the M50 motorway. Dublin Airport can be reached within a 30-minute drive. Public transport is well catered for, with regular Dublin Bus services in the area and the Luas Red Line available at nearby Saggart and Citywest, providing direct access to the city centre.\r\n\r\nPositioned on the edge of the Dublin Mountains and within easy reach of the Wicklow Mountains, the property enjoys excellent proximity to some of the region’s most scenic landscapes, offering a wealth of outdoor pursuits including walking, hiking and cycling.\r\n\r\nThe surrounding area also benefits from an excellent selection of sporting amenities, with a number of well-regarded golf courses nearby such as Slade Valley and the prestigious K-Club, as well as a variety of GAA, soccer and rugby clubs. The wider area is particularly renowned for its strong equestrian tradition, with a number of well-established racecourses, stud farms and riding schools within easy reach.\r\n\r\nThis highly accessible yet peaceful setting makes Dunard an ideal choice for those seeking a premium country residence within convenient reach of both the capital and some of Ireland’s most beautiful natural surroundings."
      }
